# Execution log: sixth project parity review remediation

## Start
- Created branch `fix/parity-sixth-review-2026-10-28` from clean revision `1ceff1eb`.
- Read the English and Traditional Chinese sixth-review plans. Scope is J01 trace-type serialization bean selection and all-bean transfer-key collection.
- Reusing the ignored `/evidence/plan/2026/10/07-project-parity-sixth-review-evidence/` bundle. Evidence must remain untracked and uncommitted.
